==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-sadness.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Etymology===
{{af|en|sad|-ness}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|sadnesses}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The state or [[emotion]] of being [[sad]].
# {{lb|en|countable}} An event in one's [[life]] that causes sadness.
#: ''She has experienced many '''sadnesses''' in her forty years.''

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|state of being sad}} {{l|en|forlornness}}, {{l|en|melancholy}}
* {{sense|event causing sadness}} {{l|en|misfortune}}, {{l|en|woe}}

